is not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[295,793,794],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[343,797],{"name":798},"select-menu-search",[317,800,802],{"id":801},"variants","Variants",[292,804,805,806,809,810,362,813,816,817,341],{},"Uses the ",[295,807,808],{},"variant",", ",[295,811,812],{},"color",[295,814,815],{},"highlight"," of ",[295,818,766],{},[343,820],{"name":821},"select-menu-variant",[317,823,825],{"id":824},"icon","Icon",[292,827,805,828,362,830,816,833,835,836,838,839,841],{},[295,829,824],{},[295,831,832],{},"trailing-icon",[295,834,766],{},"; ",[295,837,824],{}," shows on the left, and ",[295,840,832],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[343,843],{"name":844},"select-menu-icon",[317,846,848],{"id":847},"size-and-states","Size and states",[292,850,851,852,855],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[304,853,102],{"href":854},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[343,857],{"name":858},"select-menu-states",[312,860,862],{"id":861},"examples","Examples",[317,864,866],{"id":865},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[292,868,869,870,872,873,876,877,872,879,341],{},"An empty single selection is ",[295,871,332],{},", so use ",[295,874,875],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[295,878,340],{},[295,880,881],{},"requiredArray",[343,883],{"name":884},"select-menu-validation",[317,886,888],{"id":887},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[292,890,891,892,895,896,302,899,903],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[304,893,217],{"href":894},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[295,897,898],{},"ui.wrapper",[304,900,902],{"href":901},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[343,905],{"name":906},"select-menu-truncate",[317,908,910],{"id":909},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[292,912,913,914,917,918,920,921,924],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[295,915,916],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[295,919,427],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[295,922,923],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[343,926],{"name":927},"select-menu-async",[317,929,931],{"id":930},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[292,933,934,935,937],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[295,936,427],{}," are computed from the city.",[343,939],{"name":940},"select-menu-cascade",[317,942,944],{"id":943},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[292,946,947,948,951,952,955],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[295,949,950],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[295,953,954],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[343,957],{"name":958},"select-menu-expose",[312,960,962],{"id":961},"props","Props",[964,965],"component-props",{"name":400},[292,967,968,969,972,973,809,976,809,979,809,981,809,984,362,987,341],{},"See ",[304,970,102],{"href":971},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[295,974,975],{},"size",[295,977,978],{},"disabled",[295,980,916],{},[295,982,983],{},"skeleton",[295,985,986],{},"id",[295,988,989],{},"name",[292,991,992,993,996,997,362,999,1002],{},"When ",[295,994,995],{},"open"," is not set, the user opens and closes the menu; there is no v-model for it. The types of ",[295,998,566],{},[295,1000,1001],{},"clearIcon"," are inferred from another Nuxt UI generic that this component does not provide, so they are not in its types.",[312,1004,1006],{"id":1